WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.491
Spending half an hour picking what to watch… again?

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.832
This is Claqueta: your movies and shows, in one place.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:10.923
Search any title, mark it as watched… and give it your rating.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:15.639
Keep your shows up to date, episode by episode, and get notified of every new release.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.180
Can't decide? Tap “What should I watch?”, and done.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.673
Find people with your taste, and see what your friends are watching.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.241
Make your lists and see what's coming out in your calendar.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.980
And every year, your recap: hours watched, your genres… and much more!

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:37.248
Claqueta: it's free. Start today!
